NAME
       demo - demonstration utility for parser tests

SYNOPSIS
       demo [OPTION]... FILE

DESCRIPTION
       demo does things with files.

OPTIONS
       -a, --all
              process all entries

       -f, --file FILE
              read FILE instead of stdin

       --help display this help and exit

       -v     verbose output

COMMANDS
       --list
              list known items

FLAGS
       --dry-run
              do not write changes

ENVIRONMENT
       DEMO_HOME
              configuration directory

SEE ALSO
       demo(5)
